      <h1 class="Title" id="13"><a name="13"></a>Chapter 13<br>FIRE PROTECTION AND PREVENTION<sup><a name="wwfootnote_inline_68" href="/VT/Burlington/#!/Burlington13/Burlington13.html#68" rel="cgi/extract.pl?page=html/Burlington13/Burlington13.html&amp;anchor=68" class="basic">1</a></sup></h1>
